    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22147" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γηροβοσκ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόσκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nourishing</i> or <i>taking care of in old age</i>,
			esp. one's parents, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				570
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				233
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γηροβοσκὸν οὐκ ἔχω . . ταῖδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					923
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ἀποδιδόναι χάριτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					8.47
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ἐλπίδες</span> hopes <i>of
				such nurture</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>: Subst., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				7.12
			</span></i>.</div>
